      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T15:02:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note/discussion: Despite storing the sampler pointers here in `fImmutableSamplers`, there\u0027s not a great way to get its entry index information from that at this point in time. \n\nOne option would be to change this to be a map or map-like structure where the key is the bind group entry index and the value is either an immutable sampler ptr. This way, to determine if a sampler at a given entry is static, we would simply see if the map contains a key value for an entry index. This could also be adapted to have its size be equivalent to all texture/sampler entries or all sampler entries, and use nullptrs to represent non-static samplers.\n\nIf we go any of those routes, then when we want to expand this to include ycbcr detail comparison, we would then want to store YCbCr conversion information on `DawnSampler` so that could be easily fetched.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 98,
